OL,3,GNEWSAInspector overturns refusal of
OL,4,Ahomes near woodland
OL,5,
OL,6,FA government planning inspector has
OL,7,Fallowed plans for up to 100 homes to be
OL,8,Fbuilt on land next to woodland, despite
OL,9,Fhundreds of objections.
OL,11,FThe homes would be constructed between
OL,12,FHarlestone Road and York Way on the
OL,13,Fedge of Northampton, close to
OL,14,FHarlestone Firs.
OL,16,FThe decision overturns West
OL,17,FNorthamptonshire Council's rejection of
OL,18,Fthe project and allows developer
OL,19,FBarwood Development Securities Ltd to
OL,20,Fproceed.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,367,360,200,160,0,100
