OL,3,GNEWSAInspector overturns refusal of
OL,4,Ahomes near woodland
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than 700 objections were submitted
OL,7,Fby residents during the application and
OL,8,Fappeal process, with the impact on
OL,9,Fgreen space, wildlife, flooding,
OL,10,Ftraffic and local services among the
OL,11,Fissues raised.
